      "content": "i know people say things get better but i don't think i want it to get better. i just want to be where he is. it feels like i'm being punished for being left behind, like i'm stuck in this half-life while he’s at peace. wouldn't it be more peaceful if i could just... be with him? wouldn't that be more natural than forcing myself to stay in this emptiness?",
